OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death after
OL,4,Abody found
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way after a
OL,7,Fman's body was found in the Dogsthorpe
OL,8,Farea of Peterborough.
OL,10,FThe man, in his 60s, was discovered at
OL,11,Fabout 07:15 BST in Campion Road.
OL,13,FCambridgeshire Police said the man's
OL,14,Fdeath was being treated as unexplained
OL,15,Fand a post-mortem examination would
OL,16,Ftake place in due course.
OL,18,FOfficers remain at the scene while
OL,19,Finquiries continue.
